[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3900.122, "timestamp": "01:05:00", "text": "。最後我吃了東西。 美極泡麵。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3901.952, "timestamp": "01:05:01", "text": "美極泡麵。它 太棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3903.881, "timestamp": "01:05:03", "text": "太棒了。 日本的Maggi麵食與日本的Maggi麵食不同。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3905.357, "timestamp": "01:05:05", "text": "日本的Maggi麵食與日本的Maggi麵食不同。 事物。不，它是印度的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3906.982, "timestamp": "01:05:06", "text": "事物。不，它是印度的。 重要，重要，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3908.17, "timestamp": "01:05:08", "text": "重要，重要， 真正的印度人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3909.506, "timestamp": "01:05:09", "text": "真正的印度人 美極，進口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3911.632, "timestamp": "01:05:11", "text": "美極，進口。 售價230日圓。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3914.281, "timestamp": "01:05:14", "text": "售價230日圓。它  等價地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3915.173, "timestamp": "01:05:15", "text": "等價地 大約230日元，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3920.614, "timestamp": "01:05:20", "text": "大約230日元，嗯， 230日圓約合136美元"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3923.07, "timestamp": "01:05:23", "text": "230日圓約合136美元 30盧比"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3925.326, "timestamp": "01:05:25", "text": "30盧比 瑪吉。所以，這取決於……你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3930.693, "timestamp": "01:05:30", "text": "瑪吉。所以，這取決於……你。 你不應該睡覺嗎？我是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3933.136, "timestamp": "01:05:33", "text": "你不應該睡覺嗎？我是。 我本該睡了，但我卻在這裡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3939.481, "timestamp": "01:05:39", "text": "一切都結束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3943.172, "timestamp": "01:05:43", "text": "印度樂團"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3944.529, "timestamp": "01:05:44", "text": "Volcus的Maggi不好嗎？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3948.492, "timestamp": "01:05:48", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "leo ♌🦁 gang"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3948.532, "times